Z||000010||AusFiero||08-29-2001||06:32 PM||||What are Maccas prices over there anyway? Just out of interest.<BR>We pay $1.35 (US$0.71) for a cheesburger. Or when they have the specials like above we pay 50c (US 26c) for them. <BR>A Big Mac and most other burgers cost $2.45 (US$1.29). <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
